{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-17_end",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-17",
  "title": "晶簇之内",
  "storyCode": "14-19",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-17_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "23b5925bc0d68117404b36240980035fdb3c207de1924d4cec262508d0718bb4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我回到了这里。\n自己好像已经离开了很久，很久都没有回到这艘船上，睡过一个好觉。\n博士，凯尔希医生，推进之王小姐......\n外面的战争停止了吗？终于，可以休息一会了。\n可以去食堂喝一碗热乎乎的蔬菜汤，然后回到宿舍躺在自己的床上。\n特蕾西娅小姐呢？这个时候，她应该——\n......\n不......不对......\n特蕾西娅小姐已经离开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "房间是空的，没有人等待自己回来。\n可自己分明记得，曾经有一个人坐在这里，在许多夜晚，讲过许多故事哄自己入睡。\n现在，这里什么都没有剩下。\n等一下......床上为什么放着一件衣服？\n一件白色的礼裙，衣领上缝上了好看的襟花。针脚细密，是很熟悉的手艺。\n“阿米娅，很适合穿白色的衣服呢。”\n特蕾西娅小姐......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遥远的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......博士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变近的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你听得到我的声音吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "博士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "text": "博士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "text": "你果然，在这里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（好难受。）",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "（刚才发生了什么？）",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "（我现在又在哪里？）",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "你看上去身体状况不是很好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "我可能没有办法在这里对你进行身体检查，博士，请保持清醒，看着我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "你......有没有回想起什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你听到女性严厉但关怀的话语，努力地睁大眼睛。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "视野渐渐清晰，身体的部分机能也正在逐渐恢复。\n你缓缓开口——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（未知语言）凯尔希......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "（未知语言）我这是在哪里？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "——！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "破碎的意识拼凑起来，断裂的思绪恢复条理，你现在可以确信，自己正站在坚实的地面上。\n你环顾四周，你很确定这就是你熟悉的环境，你在这里度过了很长一段时光。\n而眼前的女性看向你的眼神变得陌生，甚至是，带有敌意。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（未知语言）我是谁......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我是谁？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "我是罗德岛的Dr.{@nickname}。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米娅！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "凯尔希！我们为什么在罗德岛上？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "你......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "......看上去，你还记得你是谁。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "阿米娅不在我们身边，可以确定的是，这一定不是本来的罗德岛。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我们和其他人走散了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Logos、W又在哪里？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "来到这里后我见到的只有你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "你对这一切，真的毫无头绪？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我正一头雾水。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你是不是......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......不相信我？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "......一定程度的戒备在这种情形下是必要的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "小心，博士。无论如何，我们要离开这。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "这里不是我们熟悉的环境，不知道会遇到什么意外状况。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "我还是会尽可能保护你，不要离我太远。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛丝",
          "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
          "text": "不......不行了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛丝",
          "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
          "text": "连下个月的运动量都要用光了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "芬",
          "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
          "text": "不可以这样，克洛丝！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "芬",
          "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
          "text": "现在是实战演习，要把训练室当作战场！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "米格鲁",
          "speakerId": "char_122_beagle",
          "text": "队长打人好狠......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "芬",
          "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
          "text": "都打起精神来，教官给我们安排的训练任务还有很多。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛丝",
          "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
          "text": "有什么关系嘛......反正教官又不在——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛丝",
          "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
          "text": "啊，是博士！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "早上好，克洛丝。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "大家......都在这？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "芬",
          "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
          "text": "克洛丝！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛丝",
          "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
          "text": "没关系的，博士一定不会向教官打小报告的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛丝",
          "speakerId": "char_124_kroos",
          "text": "先在这里，美美地躺上一会——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "严厉的声音",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我记得给你们安排的训练任务不是潜行伪装吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "芬",
          "speakerId": "char_123_fang",
          "text": "......完了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
          "text": "A1小队全体都有，立正！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "小队众人",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "是！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
          "text": "每个人，绕场地跑步一百圈，然后体能训练组合五十次，现在！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "小队众人",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
          "text": "让你见笑了，博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
          "text": "罗德岛确实有太长时间没有经历过战事，这些年轻的战士们有些懈怠了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
          "text": "我会负责让她们紧张起来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "能维持这样的平静，也很好......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
          "text": "当然，但也必须为可能到来的危险做准备。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
          "text": "没事的，这里的训练不劳你费心，我会处理好的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
          "text": "这段时间你辛苦了，博士，去休息吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
          "text": "放心，我们都会守在这里。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "凯尔希......你看到了吗？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我是不是在做梦？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "我看到的画面与你一致，他们确实存在于此。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "不会有这样清晰的梦境，这也并非你的回忆。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "如果这一切都是真的就好了......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "不，这一定不是真的。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "保持清醒，博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "我们还要继续向前走。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Outcast",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
          "text": "稀客，博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Outcast",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
          "text": "有时间坐下喝一杯吗？今晚所有的酒都算在我的账上。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "好热闹。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "这么多人？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Touch",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_249_1",
          "text": "你忘了吗博士，今天举办的是Outcast的退休仪式。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sharp",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_252",
          "text": "敬我们尊敬的老前辈。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Outcast",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
          "text": "够了Sharp，你也没比我小多少。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "感谢你对罗德岛的付出，Outcast。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "退休快乐。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pith",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_095",
          "text": "我们会记得你的事迹和精湛的射术的，敬你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "Outcast也要走了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "以后再也没有人，在周末晚上陪我......嗝......喝酒了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Outcast",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
          "text": "嘿，我只是退休，拉特兰的追悼会都不会有这么伤感。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Outcast",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
          "text": "再说，就算我今晚醉过去，明天一早再也没有醒来，我这一生也已经足够精彩了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Outcast",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
          "text": "与大家同行的时光是我最珍贵的宝物，我会把这段回忆连我的守护铳一起带到坟墓里去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Outcast",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
          "text": "只是以后教年轻人射击的工作就交给巡林者了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "你醉了Outcast，他用的是铳，怎么能教——嗝——萨科塔的弩。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pith",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_095",
          "text": "少喝点，都说胡话了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Outcast",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
          "text": "不都是睁一只眼闭一只眼，没太大区别。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Outcast",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_245_1",
          "text": "哦，今晚酒吧的客人不止我们呢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀罗",
          "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
          "text": "认真点达格达！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀罗",
          "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
