        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "可这种形式的“活着”，令我......悲伤。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "穿过这条走廊，见到你之后，我明白了过来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "博士，我触碰到的情感，有着同一个源头。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......我。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "我......“碰”到你了，博士。以前都没有过......"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "女孩牵住了你的手，和过去一样，又或许更加小心且用力。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "我知道的。博士和过去相比有了很多变化。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "但我们一起经历了这么多，我更确信的是......站在我面前的，一直都是我最信任的你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "回忆说不定会骗人，情感却绝不可能作假。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "还有许多事情......可能我现在也没法弄清。有些疑问，可能要等再次见到特蕾西娅小姐才能得到解答。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "无论一会将要发生什么，无论我们会遇到多么悲伤的结局......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "博士，你会和我站在一起，对吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我会。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我是罗德岛的Dr.{@nickname}。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "嗯......好的，现在这样就好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "那我们先去找到特蕾西娅小姐吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "我们先想办法离开这。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "答案不在这里。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
          "text": "虽说并非幻术所致，但天与地，生与死......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
          "text": "无一不是虚假。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
          "text": "呵呵，就算走出那憋死人的假画廊，也只能待在一个更大的舞台上兜兜转转吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
          "text": "谁给我们装的这层幕布？这品味可一点说不上好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
          "text": "哟，主角们可算到场啦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
          "text": "老女人，快，动一下你那无所不知的脑子，先回答那个最关键的问题——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
          "text": "我们，现在，到底，在哪？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "一叶小舟，漂泊在漫无边际的金色海洋上。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "这里是，“源石”的内部。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
          "text": "“源石”的内部，存在一个“宇宙”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
